129
00:11:38,139 --> 00:11:39,379
Huh? Wait, what?

130
00:11:40,279 --> 00:11:44,519
Ah, s-sorry, sorry. It's been so long since I've talked to anyone.

131
00:11:44,819 --> 00:11:48,279
If I see something that's kind of strange, I am sorry.

132
00:11:49,119 --> 00:11:52,679
Whoa, you're a human! And you're on the sixth layer!

133
00:11:53,219 --> 00:11:55,199
Are you a... a white whistle?

134
00:11:55,679 --> 00:11:57,439
What? A white... what?

135
00:11:57,439 --> 00:11:59,439
Sorry, I...

136
00:11:59,439 --> 00:12:02,239
My name's Vredo Eriko.

137
00:12:02,859 --> 00:12:05,959
It's a bit long, so people just call me... Vredo Eriko.

138
00:12:06,279 --> 00:12:08,079
And I've been down here a long time.

139
00:12:08,959 --> 00:12:12,259
I spend my days naming these little guys and singing to them.

140
00:12:12,719 --> 00:12:15,499
We have lots of free time. Isn't that right, Kati?

141
00:12:16,379 --> 00:12:20,919
So the sixth layer in white whistle... I don't know what that means, sorry.

142
00:12:21,639 --> 00:12:26,259
And you? Who are you? Why did you come down here to this awful place?

143
00:12:26,559 --> 00:12:30,199
My name's Riko! And I'm looking for Reg and Nanachi!

144
00:12:31,419 --> 00:12:32,019
For who?

145
00:12:32,019 --> 00:12:34,379
Uh... um...

146
00:12:34,379 --> 00:12:35,379
Um...

147
00:12:35,379 --> 00:12:37,379
How about...

148
00:12:37,379 --> 00:12:42,099
Uh, raho-ju-sosu, jin-jitsu, fluffu...

149
00:12:42,099 --> 00:12:43,999
No, what I mean is...

150
00:12:43,999 --> 00:12:47,119
Um, well, would you consider those two your friends?

151
00:12:47,339 --> 00:12:49,419
Yeah, I can't find them anywhere.

152
00:12:49,779 --> 00:12:51,599
So I wondered if they were here.

153
00:12:51,959 --> 00:12:55,319
Ah, do you think that's what that was just now, Jishi?

154
00:12:55,319 --> 00:12:58,679
I got a signal, so I might know about one, their location...

155
00:12:58,679 --> 00:13:01,039
Whoa, are you serious?

156
00:13:01,039 --> 00:13:03,399
Yes, I'd guide you there, but...

157
00:13:03,399 --> 00:13:06,059
Look, I can't take these off myself, you see.

158
00:13:06,719 --> 00:13:10,539
If you touch them while visualizing them releasing, it should work.

159
00:13:10,539 --> 00:13:13,899
Do those mean you're a bad person?

160
00:13:13,899 --> 00:13:14,979
Or something?

161
00:13:16,259 --> 00:13:17,259
Ugh...

162
00:13:17,259 --> 00:13:19,259
Mm-hmm...

163
00:13:19,259 --> 00:13:22,939
This village, its origins aren't very nice.

164
00:13:23,499 --> 00:13:25,059
You could even say it's cursed.

165
00:13:25,059 --> 00:13:29,559
And I, myself, have something to do with that.

166
00:13:29,559 --> 00:13:33,699
In hell, everything gets so dulled.

167
00:13:34,919 --> 00:13:38,459
And in the end, we somehow became the creators of hell.

168
00:13:39,719 --> 00:13:43,459
There was nothing I could do about the establishment of this village.

169
00:13:44,059 --> 00:13:45,679
It was the one thing I opposed.

170
00:13:46,199 --> 00:13:49,319
And as a result, I got sealed away in this darkness.

171
00:13:50,539 --> 00:13:55,579
But, you know, through the signals carried to me, I've watched over the village this whole time.

172
00:13:56,059 --> 00:13:57,499
Though its origin is horrific.

173
00:13:57,499 --> 00:14:01,959
With time, it's evolved, and it's not such a bad place now.

174
00:14:03,479 --> 00:14:09,999
The children who ended up distorted at this gathering place of curses may have lost their human bodies.

175
00:14:10,499 --> 00:14:14,799
But their souls remain, and they manage to keep carrying on.

176
00:14:17,379 --> 00:14:20,219
What was I talking about again?

177
00:14:20,839 --> 00:14:23,399
Oh, yes. Oh, no, I'm not a very good person.

178
00:14:23,399 --> 00:14:27,139
I was blinded by greed and wanted to become something beyond human.

179
00:14:27,499 --> 00:14:29,659
And for that, I cannot be forgiven.

180
00:14:34,919 --> 00:14:35,799
I'm sorry.

181
00:14:37,799 --> 00:14:40,399
The truth is, I don't care if you're a bad person.

182
00:14:40,639 --> 00:14:41,919
Could you take me to my friends?

183
00:14:42,579 --> 00:14:45,119
